        "valueString": "Denies trauma, cannulae or injections to the leg; fever, rigors or night sweats; chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations or haemoptysis; significant calf swelling away from the affected area; groin or thigh pain; rest pain or foot ulcers; current leg wounds, ooze or spreading cellulitis; weight loss or anorexia."
